&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our R&amp;amp;D Tech Hub in Warsaw&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a new R&amp;amp;D Tech Hub in Poland and are looking for people who want to make a real impact from day one. You’ll be part of a globally connected team, helping to shape the culture and ways of working at our new location. This is a hands-on role in a supportive environment, where collaboration, learning, and adaptability are key.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value practical problem-solving, diverse perspectives, and people who take ownership. If you&#39;re ready to contribute to meaningful projects and help lay the foundation for a growing team, we’d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is searching for an action-oriented servant leader&amp;nbsp; for our warehouse management system (WMS) Software Engineering and Product functions. This leader owns the full software delivery lifecycle for HelloFresh&#39;s global&amp;nbsp; warehouse fulfillment and inventory control domain — from architecture and product design through engineering execution, quality assurance, and operational reliability. You will drive a culture of product &amp;amp; engineering excellence, leveraging modern agentic tooling and AI-assisted workflows to increase team velocity, reduce defect escape rates, and accelerate deployment confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate closely with stakeholders across technology, operations, automation/production technology, procurement, and finance to deliver innovative solutions on our strategic WMS platform — Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) — while balancing competing priorities and technical resource demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Director of WMS Engineering and Product will&lt;/strong&gt; work with key technology and product leaders across HelloFresh to enable the inventory management and control domain strategy, evaluate technology-related priorities, and translate stakeholder needs into actionable roadmaps. The ideal candidate combines impeccable management and communication skills with a practitioner&#39;s instinct for modern software delivery — knowing how to build high-performing teams, establish engineering health metrics, and integrate AI-assisted tooling that meaningfully accelerates quality and velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WMS Solution Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide technical direction, development oversight, and performance accountability for HelloFresh&#39;s deployment of Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) WMS platform across all global locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration Architecture &amp;amp; Reliability: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive WMS application layer Integration architecture to upstream tooling and host systems via CI/CD pipelines [Debezium/Kafka to Snowflake/Databricks]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner/ support as needed the Hosting Architecture team in the optimal sizing and performance of WMS Architecture in AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Engineering &amp;amp; Developer Productivity: &lt;/strong&gt;Champion and drive adoption of agentic engineering practices across the team: automated code review tooling (e.g., AI-assisted PR analysis, static analysis agents, LLM-powered code quality gates), AI-augmented test generation and execution, and intelligent deployment pipelines. Measure and report the impact of these practices on delivery velocity and defect escape rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &amp;amp; Deployment Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the maturity roadmap for CI/CD pipelines. Establish automated deployment workflows with robust rollback strategies, feature flagging, environment-specific gate checks, and infrastructure-as-code practices — enabling high-confidence, low-friction releases across all WMS environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Engineering &amp;amp; Test Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with WMS Services and Support leadership to build a world-class QA function. Drive adoption of automated regression suites, AI-assisted edge case generation, and contract testing for integrations. Push teams beyond happy-path coverage toward comprehensive scenario validation, including automated performance and load testing for peak fulfillment periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Metrics &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish DORA metrics (deployment frequency, lead time for change, change failure rate, and mean time to restore) as the foundation of engineering health reporting for the WMS organization. Set baselines, publish improvement targets, and use metric trends to identify bottlenecks, prioritize tooling and process investments, and communicate engineering performance to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Roadmap &amp;amp; Architecture Governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with peers and senior leadership on architectural decision-making for WMS platform evolution, integration patterns, and technology transitions. Champion the use of structured design reviews to maintain coherent, scalable technical direction. Lead evaluations to refactor or replace legacy systems, including risk mitigation and transition planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Capacity Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with department leadership to source and partner with 3rd-party vendors to augment internal engineering capacity and expertise. Maintain vendor performance accountability and ensure structured knowledge transfer to build durable internal capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Talent Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Coach, develop, and retain high-performing engineers, product managers, and team leads. Partner with HR and Talent Acquisition to build organizational depth — playing an active role in recruiting, onboarding, and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Standardization/ Release Consolidation. &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with departmental leadership, peer domains,&amp;nbsp; and executive leadership to own the long term roadmap for product consolidation to a single application release version administered globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Leadership. &lt;/strong&gt;Serve on both the Fulfillment Technology and overall Automation &amp;amp; Technology leadership teams, reinforcing HelloFresh DNA values, establishing KPIs, and prioritizing strategic initiatives at a departmental level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Engineering Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of warehouse management system (WMS) software engineering and implementation experience with a tier-one WMS in an RF-based distribution, manufacturing, or e-commerce fulfillment environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of direct hands-on experience with Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) WMS platform with SQL Server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years managing application integrations via microservices and associated toolsets, including REST APIs, event-driven architectures, and ETL pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience implementing or scaling CI/CD pipelines, including automated testing gates, deployment automation, and infrastructure-as-code (IaC) practices across multi-environment WMS or fulfillment technology stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with agentic and AI-assisted engineering tools — including automated code review platforms, AI-assisted test generation, and LLM-powered developer productivity tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot, CodeRabbit, SonarQube AI, or equivalent) — with a track record of driving meaningful team-wide adoption and measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and tracking engineering delivery and quality metrics (DORA metrics or equivalent) and using data to drive process improvement and leadership reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading evaluations to refactor or replace legacy systems, including developing and executing technology transition plans with appropriate risk mitigation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a design and product process that scales a digital technology operations ecosystem across volume growth, multiple brands, and new digital properties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with the ability to build and execute innovative digital product strategy while executing tactically against multiple competing priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate business requirements into technical specifications, roadmaps, and delivery plans — and to communicate progress and tradeoffs clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build leadership support for proactive technology investments, making the business case for engineering quality, automation, and platform modernization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh Group better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health - &lt;/strong&gt;You’re covered from your first day with&amp;nbsp; private health insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working - &lt;/strong&gt;We work in-office 3 days a week to align on goals, with flexible hours to support work-life balance and personal needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off - &lt;/strong&gt;You receive 26 days of paid vacation each year, providing you time to rest and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development - &lt;/strong&gt;An annual Learning &amp;amp; Development budget and a Mentoring Program to support your ongoing professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Referral Program - &lt;/strong&gt;Our team members can take part in our internal employee referral program and receive a bonus for recommending successful candidates to open roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Comforts - &lt;/strong&gt;Free coffee, drinks, and fresh fruit are available to keep you refreshed throughout the day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Flix, we offer a tech-driven environment where innovation meets real-world impact, with competitive pay, strong growth opportunities, and a culture of collaboration and ownership. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;123&quot; data-local-id=&quot;89a0e047ba4c&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flix is building the global platform for affordable and sustainable ground travel, from next-generation train offerings in Europe to rapid expansion in high-growth markets such as India. As our network becomes broader and more complex, Search plays a critical role in helping millions of customers find the right journey quickly, confidently, and intuitively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;485&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7a3ca574c08a&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Owner/Manager&lt;/strong&gt; in Demand Division you will be able to turn Search into a true growth engine for Flix: a product experience that understands customer intent, reduces complexity, improves conversion, and creates valuable demand signals for the business across web, app, and emerging AI-native channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;485&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7a3ca574c08a&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will define the north star for Flix Search and own the roadmap through a major product and technical transformation. You will work closely with engineering, UX, data, commercial, and operational stakeholders to evolve Search from a functional step in the booking funnel into a personalised, intelligent, and scalable discovery experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1163&quot; data-local-id=&quot;36e69d70&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Set and communicate a compelling product vision and strategy for Search, grounded in customer needs, business impact, and market opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1308&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2f29e1d8&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and prioritise opportunities across ranking, relevance, comparison, query understanding, personalisation, and zero-result recovery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1452&quot; data-local-id=&quot;67351169&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Use data such as conversion impact, query behaviour, and customer feedback to diagnose problems and guide product decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1581&quot; data-local-id=&quot;70e7638c&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead discovery and delivery with cross-functional teams, balancing quick customer-facing improvements with long-term platform and architectural needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1735&quot; data-local-id=&quot;33fd64b9&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Align stakeholders around trade-offs, success metrics, and roadmap priorities in an ambiguous and strategically important product area&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1874&quot; data-local-id=&quot;43cb25eb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Explore how Search can support new surfaces and behaviours, including AI-native discovery and conversational travel planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2016&quot; data-local-id=&quot;560ed1c2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You have 8+ years of product management experience, ideally including ownership of a search, discovery, marketplace, recommendation, or other high-intent digital product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2190&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3e9cd0de&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You have led meaningful product changes in complex environments and can connect product strategy with hands-on execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2314&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e15a792&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You are highly data-informed and know how to turn behavioural, funnel, and query-level insights into clear product direction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2443&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4d6067d1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You are comfortable partnering with engineering on technical topics such as APIs, ranking, machine learning, performance, and architectural trade-offs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2598&quot; data-local-id=&quot;272a4379&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You are a strong communicator who can build trust across engineering, UX, data, and business teams and create alignment when priorities compete&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2746&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0b19d415&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You are energised by unsolved problems and motivated to understand why a customer experience is not working, not only how to close the next ticket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2897&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4ec8e61d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You are fluent in English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2927&quot; data-local-id=&quot;72f3f906&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2944&quot; data-local-id=&quot;74030f30&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with travel, mobility, marketplaces, e-commerce, or other high-scale consumer platforms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3047&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4ad03a2f&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience building or improving AI-assisted, personalised, or conversational discovery experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3151&quot; data-local-id=&quot;19e90ea4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;German or another European language skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We recognize that everyone carries a unique set of valuable skills and experiences. If you think you could have an impact even though you don&#39;t meet 100% of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply. We want to hear from you! &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11445&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Travel perks&lt;/strong&gt;: 12 free Flix vouchers + 12 discount vouchers for friends &amp;amp; family.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11530&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Work from (M)Anywhere&lt;/strong&gt;: Depending on your role, work from another location for up to 60 days per year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11636&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Hybrid work model&lt;/strong&gt;: We are an office-first company, but we offer flexibility to balance work and life.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11742&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Wellbeing support&lt;/strong&gt;: Access confidential 1:1 counselling, courses, and stress management for yourself and up to four family members.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11877&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Take advantage of language classes, training courses, and expert-led sessions to grow your skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12004&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mentoring Program&lt;/strong&gt;: Connect with experienced colleagues to gain insights and accelerate your career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;To view more local benefits specific to each office location, please check out this link:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://flix.careers/locations/&quot;&gt;Locations - Flix Career&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Flix?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;14351&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Flix, we empower our teams to push boundaries and shape the future of mobility. As we continue to scale globally, we harness cutting-edge technology to make mobility smarter, more sustainable, and more affordable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;14569&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re looking for a place where you can drive change and redefine how millions of people travel, Flix is the place where you can lead your journey!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
